                    <li>Partnered with HR to establish the company's first structured technical Job Description and candidate evaluation rubric for backend systems. Designed practical coding assessments evaluating systems thinking and TDD, conducted engineering interviews, and successfully hired an engineer into the team.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
